    <briefdescription>
<para>Weak reference for the function that is to be called at some point in the future on the context of the specified frame if the corresponding service is still running. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The idea behind the <ref refid="d3/d26/classorg_1_1xvm_1_1runtime_1_1_weak_callback" kindref="compound">WeakCallback</ref> is that it can retrieve all necessary information to create a <computeroutput><ref refid="da/dd8/classorg_1_1xvm_1_1runtime_1_1_service_context_1_1_call_later_request" kindref="compound">ServiceContext.CallLaterRequest</ref></computeroutput> using a unique id, but does not itself hold that data, therefore not preventing the underlying service from being stopped and GC&apos;d. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
